WEBVTT

01:58.644 --> 02:00.111
I...

02:00.946 --> 02:02.413
I...

02:03.482 --> 02:04.949
I...

02:07.219 --> 02:10.052
I have absolutely nothing
to do with this story.

02:11.757 --> 02:13.224
Farewell!

02:25.371 --> 02:26.838
There it is!

02:29.041 --> 02:31.373
The Capital of Thieves!

03:03.609 --> 03:08.273
The Capital of Thieves

03:21.493 --> 03:25.020
I wonder which one of them
could be the Bandit King?

03:29.835 --> 03:31.393
What's a kid doing coming here?

03:34.273 --> 03:37.643
I don't care who the Bandit King is,

03:37.643 --> 03:40.703
he'll never get his hands on
my Double Mermaids!

03:41.146 --> 03:44.707
I won't ever allow anyone to waltz in
and disturb my great city!

03:48.720 --> 03:50.989
Take it away you thief!

03:50.989 --> 03:53.389
This is the city of refuge
for all us thieves!

03:55.527 --> 03:57.262
This truly is the Capital
of Thieves, isn't it?

03:57.262 --> 04:00.390
Seems like we'll find nothing but
scoundrels and bad types here, Jing.

04:01.033 --> 04:02.728
You mean bad as in stupid,
right, Kir?

04:03.469 --> 04:04.936
What the hell's this?!

04:05.370 --> 04:07.895
They say the Bandit King
sent in a warning notice.

04:08.273 --> 04:09.875
Bandit King?!

04:09.875 --> 04:13.245
Bandit King doesn't mean he's
king of a real country.

04:13.245 --> 04:16.442
It supposedly just means that
he's the best bandit ever.

04:16.915 --> 04:19.318
He's the legendary bandit

04:19.318 --> 04:21.013
they say could steal the very stars
out of the sky if he wanted to.

04:21.386 --> 04:23.320
I bet Cognac is really sweatin' it.

04:27.326 --> 04:29.862
Wow, this truly is a guy's
town, isn't it?

04:29.862 --> 04:31.263
You could almost suffocate

04:31.263 --> 04:32.965
on the foul, manly stench that
exudes from this place.

04:32.965 --> 04:36.301
C'mon Jing, let's go to another town
that has more women!

04:36.301 --> 04:37.768
There's a girl.

04:39.371 --> 04:41.066
Geez! Jing!

04:41.607 --> 04:45.511
Haven't you heard that women, like
wine, just get better with age?

04:45.511 --> 04:48.173
You know I prefer the
young ones, Jing!

04:50.382 --> 04:54.753
Hey kid, you just lost all your
treasure there.

04:54.753 --> 04:56.516
Thief!

04:57.890 --> 05:00.726
Everyone here is a thief.

05:00.726 --> 05:03.286
He's gone beyond your reach now.

05:03.695 --> 05:05.162
Oh, I can reach him.

05:06.732 --> 05:08.199
I've got this guy on my side.

05:33.725 --> 05:35.192
See?

05:38.030 --> 05:40.123
What the hell!? You want
a piece of me, kid?

05:52.377 --> 05:54.777
Oh here you go, I was just
borrowing these.

05:56.682 --> 05:58.547
I could care less about those jewels,

05:58.984 --> 06:00.451
but no one touches this one.

06:14.800 --> 06:16.859
Not too bad, kid.

06:18.503 --> 06:19.970
It's that old maid from before!

06:20.505 --> 06:23.303
You should watch your mouth around
a young lady like myself.

06:25.744 --> 06:27.507
Is this your first time here?

06:27.946 --> 06:29.436
Have you been here long?

06:29.881 --> 06:31.116
You could say that.

06:31.116 --> 06:33.685
Do you know anything about
the Double Mermaids?

06:33.685 --> 06:36.221
It's supposed to be a jewel
as huge as this jackass.

06:36.221 --> 06:39.054
What'd you call me?!

06:41.360 --> 06:42.918
You haven't seen the last of me!

06:46.798 --> 06:47.799
Know it?

06:47.799 --> 06:50.135
It's the ultimate goal in
this world of thieves.

06:50.135 --> 06:52.404
Everyone comes to this town

06:52.404 --> 06:54.806
with the hope of someday getting
their grubby hands on it.

06:54.806 --> 06:58.105
So all of these animals are
after the mermaids too?

06:58.744 --> 07:00.268
Look above you...

07:00.846 --> 07:03.048
It's at the top of this tower?!

07:03.048 --> 07:06.385
This is where Cognac, the mayor,
keeps all of his secret treasure.

07:06.385 --> 07:10.589
It's tight as a drum.
No one will ever get in.

07:10.589 --> 07:14.059
But still everyone is here to try
and get the Double Mermaids.

07:14.059 --> 07:16.762
Cognac captures everyone who
tries to break in to his tower,

07:16.762 --> 07:20.129
and in return takes their
treasure as his own.

07:20.399 --> 07:22.968
Cognac just keeps getting
richer and richer

07:22.968 --> 07:26.062
by collecting all the money
of his victims.

07:26.805 --> 07:29.074
In addition to that,

07:29.074 --> 07:32.942
he makes everyone who lives here
pay him taxes.

07:33.712 --> 07:37.349
It has been like that here under
Cognac for a long time.

07:37.349 --> 07:40.443
Seems like that evil Cognac's
got quite a system going.

07:40.819 --> 07:43.014
He's really milking everyone dry.

07:43.689 --> 07:46.886
He may be a bad guy, but he's
sure got a lot of dough.

07:47.592 --> 07:49.428
So is that good or bad for us?

07:49.428 --> 07:52.164
I must warn you of the dangers
of entering the tower.

07:52.164 --> 07:55.497
Attempting to infiltrate the tower
means almost certain death.

07:55.767 --> 07:59.604
Cognac has set countless traps
to ensure that all are captured.

07:59.604 --> 08:01.765
You must not underestimate
its strength.

08:02.040 --> 08:03.408
Certain death?

08:03.408 --> 08:06.571
I guess he needs all that to protect
his Double Mermaids.

08:07.012 --> 08:08.673
Are there really two of them?

08:09.214 --> 08:13.412
There are two of them, but Cognac
is only in possession of one.

08:14.019 --> 08:17.011
But it is his most prized possession.

08:19.491 --> 08:21.526
You must learn more if you really
mean to attempt this feat.

08:21.526 --> 08:24.427
If you go to the bar called
Dragon Pow,

08:25.030 --> 08:26.965
you will find an old, veteran bandit
by the name of Vodka.

08:26.965 --> 08:29.234
He has all the information you need.

08:29.234 --> 08:31.395
Thank you, we'll see you around.

08:36.141 --> 08:40.045
What are you doing telling that old
hag that we'd see her again?

08:40.045 --> 08:42.206
I just got the feeling that we're going
to meet again sometime soon.

08:43.548 --> 08:45.516
Here we are, the Dragon Pow.

08:50.956 --> 08:52.947
Don't sleep naked like that
or you'll catch a cold.

09:05.270 --> 09:07.465
I really like the atmosphere
in this place.

09:14.012 --> 09:18.676
Let me go show you how it's done.
I feel like indulging myself tonight.

09:19.084 --> 09:20.551
Don't go overboard, Kir.

09:35.200 --> 09:36.168
Are you Vodka?

09:36.168 --> 09:37.795
Who the hell wants to know?

09:38.236 --> 09:39.938
You were quite easy to spot.

09:39.938 --> 09:43.775
You stick out among these other jokers

09:43.775 --> 09:45.367
as one who has been an easy target
for Cognac for a long time.

09:47.946 --> 09:49.614
You little brat!

09:49.614 --> 09:52.083
Do you have any idea who
you're talking to?!

09:52.083 --> 09:55.883
Hey kid, I wouldn't upset him
if I were you!

09:56.788 --> 10:00.659
Don't you know that Master Vodka is
one of the greatest thieves ever!

10:00.659 --> 10:03.219
Check it out!
My magnificent collection!

10:05.931 --> 10:08.166
I know something that
will astound you!

10:08.166 --> 10:10.168
There is no other like it
in the whole world,

10:10.168 --> 10:12.136
I hide it in here for safekeeping.

10:15.040 --> 10:16.141
You mean this?

10:16.141 --> 10:18.200
Oh, I thought it was a cavity, so
I took the liberty of removing it!

10:22.147 --> 10:23.512
When did he snatch it?!
I never saw him move!

10:24.883 --> 10:28.253
Oh, you guys are even more beautiful
than the Double Mermaids.

10:28.253 --> 10:30.622
Oh stop it, you're too kind.

10:30.622 --> 10:34.114
That reminds me, I have a
present here for you two.

10:38.196 --> 10:39.823
Let us buy you a few more drinks.

10:41.700 --> 10:45.103
You little brat! You snatched
my precious treasure.

10:45.103 --> 10:46.438
If this is that important to you,

10:46.438 --> 10:48.372
allow me to ask you about an even
more spectacular treasure.

10:52.677 --> 10:54.144
He swallowed it.

10:54.546 --> 10:56.070
Master?!

10:56.581 --> 10:59.072
Settle down, you don't have
to thank me.

11:02.053 --> 11:03.714
That's it punk!

11:04.589 --> 11:06.216
Say goodbye!

11:14.766 --> 11:16.358
Time to go to work, Kir.

11:33.218 --> 11:34.776
Kir Royale!

11:51.870 --> 11:54.673
Hey, Jing, you have the worst timing
ever. I was just about to get some.

11:54.673 --> 11:56.141
Have your hiccoughs stopped yet?

11:56.141 --> 11:57.608
Not yet!

11:58.143 --> 11:59.508
Boy...

12:00.545 --> 12:04.709
You don't have to speak another word.
I know what you are after!

12:05.350 --> 12:08.046
From this day forward
I will be your mentor!

12:29.040 --> 12:30.530
Sorry for the wait.

12:33.078 --> 12:34.813
Another failed attempt...

12:34.813 --> 12:36.280
What idiots.

12:36.815 --> 12:39.384
Hey, kid, you going to
try your luck too?

12:39.384 --> 12:41.545
No, he's not quite ready yet.

12:42.087 --> 12:45.215
Oh, yeah? I used to be
a bandit as well.

12:45.957 --> 12:47.424
So good luck.

12:47.892 --> 12:49.359
What an idiot!

12:49.761 --> 12:53.898
Let's hurry up, snatch the Double
Mermaids and get out of here!

12:53.898 --> 12:56.594
I'd rather be chasing after real women
than those who are half fish!

12:58.336 --> 12:59.404
Hey, it's you!

12:59.404 --> 13:00.871
We meet again.

13:01.806 --> 13:03.273
What's that?

13:06.578 --> 13:09.877
It looks like one of those valuable
birds that rarely lay eggs.

13:10.415 --> 13:14.386
She's the newest addition
to Cognac's collection.

13:14.386 --> 13:15.910
I feel sorry for her.

13:30.368 --> 13:32.170
Have you heard?

13:32.170 --> 13:34.272
There is a rumor going around that
the Double Mermaids have

13:34.272 --> 13:37.503
an even more valuable treasure
sleeping inside of them.

13:44.949 --> 13:47.110
Do you know what he meant by that?

13:47.652 --> 13:50.120
He was a little vague, wasn't he?

13:53.091 --> 13:54.558
All right, the plans are set.

13:54.993 --> 13:58.196
We're going to make a balloon that
we can ride to the top of the tower.

13:58.196 --> 13:59.686
You don't have to do that.

14:00.265 --> 14:01.755
We can just ride her up to the top.

14:08.573 --> 14:11.599
That thing? She's got wings,
but she can't fly!

14:12.477 --> 14:14.212
She used to be able to fly,

14:14.212 --> 14:15.770
but then her body got fat
and her wings shrunk.

14:16.281 --> 14:18.545
Even if she was set free,

14:18.950 --> 14:22.750
she wouldn't even be able to fly
back to her own nest!

14:23.888 --> 14:26.186
A bird that can't fly shouldn't be
called a bird at all.

14:27.192 --> 14:28.955
All right! Let's go!

14:32.330 --> 14:34.199
It was such a ingenious idea of mine

14:34.199 --> 14:35.723
to have you guys use your clothes
to make the balloon.

14:35.967 --> 14:38.303
I guess being broke has affected
their sense of reason.

14:38.303 --> 14:39.370
No kidding.

14:39.370 --> 14:42.907
Shut up you brat! We'll bring
you back a souvenir,

14:42.907 --> 14:46.172
so have some drinks lined up for us
when we return! Okay?!

14:47.378 --> 14:49.744
With this thing the mermaid
is as good as mine!

14:52.750 --> 14:54.684
I really hate the way human
males look naked.

14:58.056 --> 15:00.251
All right, almost there...

15:07.132 --> 15:11.669
I have to give you guys credit.
Your idea is pretty original,

15:11.669 --> 15:13.136
but not quite good enough.

15:27.352 --> 15:29.912
Just as I thought. You guys went
overweight on the balloon.

15:30.321 --> 15:32.757
You got a better idea!

15:32.757 --> 15:35.160
I don't know, I'll tell you
after I'm up there.

15:35.160 --> 15:36.861
Shut up!

15:36.861 --> 15:41.366
I can't take it, none of us are making
money as thieves anymore.

15:41.366 --> 15:43.027
That's just how it is
in our profession.

15:47.505 --> 15:48.972
Jing?

15:49.774 --> 15:51.042
An egg!

15:51.042 --> 15:53.101
I can't believe it, finally she laid one.

15:53.478 --> 15:55.810
We must hurry and deliver it
to Lord Cognac.

16:00.585 --> 16:02.018
Oh, shut up!

16:03.454 --> 16:07.652
Cognac is always separating
children from their mothers.

16:15.867 --> 16:17.960
All right, we've got to think
of a new strategy!

16:18.503 --> 16:19.737
That's not necessary.

16:19.737 --> 16:21.105
What the?!

16:21.105 --> 16:22.936
I'm going to take this bird
to the top.

16:24.242 --> 16:27.212
What! I already told you,
that thing can't fly!

16:27.212 --> 16:29.881
Jing! What are you talking about?
It's not going to happen.

16:29.881 --> 16:31.906
I'm a bird, take it from me,
she isn't flying!

16:32.717 --> 16:35.277
Hey, girl, why are you so sad?

16:36.087 --> 16:38.385
Is it because you're never allowed
to hatch your own eggs?

16:39.090 --> 16:43.652
As we speak, that guy in there is
eating your eggs sunny-side-up.

16:45.496 --> 16:47.232
Or maybe he's boiling them?

16:47.232 --> 16:48.665
What are you...

16:51.636 --> 16:53.797
I can hear them sizzling
in the pan right now!

17:00.411 --> 17:01.412
There you go, girl.

17:01.412 --> 17:04.649
The only way you can get them back
is to grow your wings.

17:04.649 --> 17:06.981
If you don't save your children,
no one else will.

17:07.652 --> 17:09.119
Show everyone that you can do it!

17:13.791 --> 17:15.493
Let's go, lady.

17:15.493 --> 17:17.620
Are you taking her as your date?!

17:32.410 --> 17:33.877
I can't believe it!

17:45.023 --> 17:48.151
I can't believe she's really flying.

17:53.164 --> 17:56.895
All right, what poor sucker
do we have up next?

17:58.703 --> 18:00.671
Hey, I thought she couldn't fly.

18:06.311 --> 18:07.778
It didn't make a scratch!

18:18.323 --> 18:20.951
That little brat finally
made it up there.

18:25.296 --> 18:27.696
I guess they haven't had a chance
to boil it up yet.

18:57.161 --> 18:58.628
The Double Mermaids...

19:00.498 --> 19:03.501
The Double Mermaids, are they really

19:03.501 --> 19:05.435
the famous crystallized creatures
from the stories of old?

19:11.876 --> 19:15.744
Oh, my precious breathtaking beauty...

19:16.381 --> 19:19.441
I see you have grown to love
my treasure as I have.

19:20.051 --> 19:23.221
I can't believe you made it up here,

19:23.221 --> 19:25.390
and for that I will commend you.

19:25.390 --> 19:30.054
But I have heard that I should be
expecting the Bandit King.

19:30.661 --> 19:32.754
I have no time to waste with
a little boy like you.

19:52.116 --> 19:53.674
Kir Royale!

20:01.492 --> 20:05.096
Oh, fair maiden, it is I who has
saved you from this prison.

20:05.096 --> 20:07.792
Get away, you old hag! I'm the one
who's going to get to hug her!

20:14.138 --> 20:15.239
Mother!

20:15.239 --> 20:16.797
Cidre!

20:18.242 --> 20:21.507
So "double" means mother
and daughter?

20:21.746 --> 20:23.407
So that's what that old lady
really looks like?!

20:24.215 --> 20:29.414
Thank you! You have returned to me
my only treasure.

20:30.788 --> 20:32.255
Mother!

20:42.400 --> 20:45.198
I guess this was what Postino
was talking about.

20:46.904 --> 20:54.003
Why? She always used to cry, but
her tears never turned into jewels!

21:03.988 --> 21:05.649
Tears of sadness...

21:06.357 --> 21:08.018
Tears of joy...

21:09.193 --> 21:10.854
They're far from the same.

21:18.503 --> 21:20.698
It can't be! You?!

21:22.006 --> 21:24.474
You're the Bandit King!?
